                }
            ],
            "product_type": "literature",
            "titles": {
                "en": "The Extermination of Jews in the Kalinindorf Jewish National Raion of 1941",
                "ru": "ИСТРЕБЛЕНИЕ ЕВРЕЕВ В КАЛИНИНДОРФСКОМ ЕВРЕЙСКОМ НАЦИОНАЛЬНОМ РАЙОНЕ ОСЕНЬЮ 1941 г."
            },
            "abstracts": {
                "en": "In 1927 the Kalinindorf Raion was established as a Jewish national raion, created from parts of the Beryslav and Snihurivka Raions of Mykolaïv Oblast, in the Ukrainian SSR. It was the first Jewish national raion not only in Ukraine, but in the USSR as a whole. Initially, the raion included seven village soviets."
            },
